<title>GREECE: GREEK INFLATION FIRMS TO 5.5PCT Y/Y IN JUNE-SOURCE.</title>
<headline>GREEK INFLATION FIRMS TO 5.5PCT Y/Y IN JUNE-SOURCE.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greece's CPI inflation edged up to 5.5 percent year-on-year in June from 5.4 percent in May, a monetary source told Reuters.</p>
<p>The National Statistics Service will release the official inflation figure later today. --Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
